WEBVTT

00:21:59.667 --> 00:22:02.101
AG: I joined the science
advisory board at BetterUp,

00:22:02.125 --> 00:22:05.893
because coaches have been fundamental
in helping me at every point in my career.

00:22:05.917 --> 00:22:08.518
I believe everyone should
have a coach in their corner.

00:22:08.542 --> 00:22:11.601
If you'd like to work with greater
clarity, purpose and passion,

00:22:11.625 --> 00:22:15.792
you can get a free trial with BetterUp
at betterup.com/worklife.

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:25.792
(Upbeat music)